nnection between the area of $D$ and the area of the image $T(D)$ under the action of $T:$\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(T(D))=|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D).\n$$\n\nFrom the diagram, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(D)=4\\cdot 2=8.\n$$\n\nComputing the determinant of $T,$ we get \n\n$$\ndet(T)=(-1)\\cdot 1-2\\cdot 3=-7.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(T(D)) & =|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =|\\,-7\\,|\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =56.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297508 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b2e48f4c-e7a5-532b-a964-bb5257c59356" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296212}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296212} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5769962-31bc-56d6-9273-44b39f9964f8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297041}] :question/id #uuid "6c24d250-c966-5806-b13d-89fc68943e50" :question/math-academy-id "q-316593" :question/problem "![](images/9e/9eb3ccd040b0a8bca45f30780e62bd77fdd3333005e748ad40d47afc20f82ea4.png)\n\nConsider the shaded region $D$ shown above. What is the area of the image of $D$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ with the standard matrix $T,$ given below?\n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$\\text{Area}(T(D))=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that for any linear transformation $T,$ we have the following connection between the area of $D$ and the area of the image $T(D)$ under the action of $T:$\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(T(D))=|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D).\n$$\n\nFrom the diagram, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(D)=\\frac{1}{2}\\,(3+3)\\cdot 2=6.\n$$\n\nComputing the determinant of $T,$ we get \n\n$$\ndet(T)=0\\cdot 0-2\\cdot 3=-6.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(T(D)) & =|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =|\\,-6\\,